micropolis-core (0.0.20250405+gitc591573+ds1-0ubuntu1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Package the upstream web release built from Git commit c591573.
  * Vendor the matching upstream-published static deployment so package
    builds remain offline and do not depend on Node.js or pnpm.
  * Add a loopback-only launcher that serves Micropolis Core locally and opens
    the user's default browser.
  * Build the binary package as Architecture: any intentionally, allowing
    Launchpad to exercise the source package on every enabled Noble
    architecture, including i386 and s390x.
  * Add desktop integration, AppStream metadata, a manual page, and an
    autopkgtest smoke test covering HTML and WebAssembly delivery.

